    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle the rogue Robots and Master AI on the Moons of Jupiter and Saturn.</strong><br><br>In the 2030's mankind landed on Mars and discovered an alien near-light-speed artifact.<br>This artifact was used to travel to the moons of Jupiter and Saturn, where humans built transforming machines to make the moons habitable.\u00a0 A Master AI was used for control of the moon stations.<br><br>In 2321, the Master AI went rogue, destroyed all humans on the moons, and infected all worker robots.<br><br>Back on Earth, they developed the Android Incursion Assassin robot, Andria for short, and sent her to the Mars Orbital Station where she teleported to each moon to restore control back to Earth and defeat the Master AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606700/extras/5af3bddbf43d508eca2ed87aa39c1d56.avif?t=1750723324\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Visit seven unique and highly detailed moons, each designed to give a new visual and game play experience.\u00a0 Battle the rogue robots at their outposts on the moons, and scan the different alien life that lives on each moon.\u00a0 Alien life can be fought to gain additional XP Points, but beware because they may attack.\u00a0 Then defeat the Boss Robot controlling the moon, and hack the local server system to return the moon computer's control back to earth.<br><br>Locate the Environment Suit for the next moon, to be able to withstand its harsh atmosphere. And find the Server Key Card to allow for server hacking access.<br><br>Each battle awards you XP Skill Points, which can be spent on seven different skills to buff up your player.\u00a0 These include Maximum Power Level, Maximum Shield Level, Soldier Maximum Ammo Carry Capacity, and more!\u00a0 Spend the XP Points wisely to be able to defeat all of the bosses.\u00a0 Plus have more game replay by playing the game with different XP setups for the next play through.<br><br>Pickup crates are spread around each moon, allowing you to equip Andria with more power, shield, and ammo.\u00a0 There are also specialty crates that recharge and that give multi-pickups.<br><br>And finally confront the Master AI Quantum Computer with its Drone Army, and fight to defeat the Master AI and return full control of the moons back to earth.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle the rogue Robots and Master AI on the Moons of Jupiter and Saturn.</strong><br><br>In the 2030's mankind landed on Mars and discovered an alien near-light-speed artifact.<br>This artifact was used to travel to the moons of Jupiter and Saturn, where humans built transforming machines to make the moons habitable.\u00a0 A Master AI was used for control of the moon stations.<br><br>In 2321, the Master AI went rogue, destroyed all humans on the moons, and infected all worker robots.<br><br>Back on Earth, they developed the Android Incursion Assassin robot, Andria for short, and sent her to the Mars Orbital Station where she teleported to each moon to restore control back to Earth and defeat the Master AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606700/extras/5af3bddbf43d508eca2ed87aa39c1d56.avif?t=1750723324\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Visit seven unique and highly detailed moons, each designed to give a new visual and game play experience.\u00a0 Battle the rogue robots at their outposts on the moons, and scan the different alien life that lives on each moon.\u00a0 Alien life can be fought to gain additional XP Points, but beware because they may attack.\u00a0 Then defeat the Boss Robot controlling the moon, and hack the local server system to return the moon computer's control back to earth.<br><br>Locate the Environment Suit for the next moon, to be able to withstand its harsh atmosphere. And find the Server Key Card to allow for server hacking access.<br><br>Each battle awards you XP Skill Points, which can be spent on seven different skills to buff up your player.\u00a0 These include Maximum Power Level, Maximum Shield Level, Soldier Maximum Ammo Carry Capacity, and more!\u00a0 Spend the XP Points wisely to be able to defeat all of the bosses.\u00a0 Plus have more game replay by playing the game with different XP setups for the next play through.<br><br>Pickup crates are spread around each moon, allowing you to equip Andria with more power, shield, and ammo.\u00a0 There are also specialty crates that recharge and that give multi-pickups.<br><br>And finally confront the Master AI Quantum Computer with its Drone Army, and fight to defeat the Master AI and return full control of the moons back to earth.</p>",
    "short_description": "A Sci-fi First-Person-Shooter set on the Moons of Jupiter and Saturn. Scan the local alien creatures and robots to obtain technical data. Battle the guard robots and defeat the Master AI.",
